     "proposal": "The roadmap offers three Reasonable options rather than one answer: resect before conception (lesion comfortably over 5 cm, exophytic or after a complicated pregnancy, non-major resection, with a named date); embolise; or proceed with 6-weekly ultrasound for a 5-6 cm non-exophytic, non-beta-catenin lesion. Obstetrics attends every pregnancy case, with a same-week slot for a growing lesion.",
