    {
     "t": "Documented cirrhosis is required; a candidate without cirrhosis is not submitted under this pathway and needs a separately justified nonstandard request reviewed by the selection committee.",
     "why": "Guidance population. Cirrhosis is part of the NLRB category and appears in the explanatory text of AASLD/AST statement 11 (weak recommendation, level 4 evidence). The cited small-tumor transplant cohorts are incidental tumors in cirrhotic explants (for example De Martin 2020); no transplant outcome data for noncirrhotic small iCCA are cited. Track noncirrhotic referrals and how they were handled.",
     "setting": "standard",
     "locator": "Standard pathway document §2.1 Inclusion Criteria; decision 'Check clinical selection criteria'",
