      "href": "#high-risk-icca-b1"
     }
    },
    {
     "t": "Macrovascular invasion excludes the candidate.",
     "why": "Local exclusion. It is not among the NLRB criteria the protocol lists, and the cited source (Schleimer 2026) is a non-transplant eligibility cohort; the Houston advanced-iCCA series also excluded major vascular encasement. No transplant outcome comparison by vascular invasion is cited. The open high-risk review would allow encasement without tumor thrombus in the advanced study. Track vascular findings on the explant.",
