    {
     "t": "Prior liver resection does not by itself exclude a candidate; recurrent or other outside-guidance presentations need explicit multidisciplinary and individual allocation review.",
     "why": "Clinical reasoning. NLRB guidance does not list prior resection as an exclusion. The only transplant experience after resection that the protocol cites is a single-center advanced-iCCA series in which four previously resected patients were listed and three transplanted (McMillan 2022); that research cohort does not establish eligibility for the standard route. Track previously resected candidates, selection decisions and recurrence.",
