      }
     ],
     "related": null
    },
    {
     "t": "After transplant, chest CT plus abdominal/pelvic CT or MRI every 3 months in years 1–2 and every 6 months in years 3–5, with CA 19-9 and CEA at each visit, then annual follow-up as indicated.",
     "why": "Institutional proposal. The protocol states this is not the schedule of the cited incidental biliary-cancer series (Heinrich 2026), which imaged every 6 months for 3 years and then annually; selected transplant data do not define an optimal interval. The group is to approve modality, interval, contrast adaptations and escalation triggers and record the rationale. Track how recurrences are detected.",
     "setting": "standard",
     "locator": "Standard pathway document §9.1 Oncologic Surveillance; decision 'Transplant and follow-up'",
     "refs": [],
